{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "9955b8f1-0228-51e7-bcd8-206f811b654e", "source_ordinal": 2360, "reading_ordinal": 1694, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "绝户计", "published_at": "2023-03-08T23:54:05+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/302878284/answer/2927652907"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "两份遗嘱就可以解决问题：", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 12}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "1）父母的遗嘱明确指明受益人是自己的女儿，而非女儿夫妇。这样这份遗产就不属于夫妻共同财产。", "char_start": 13, "char_end": 58}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "2）女儿自己写明遗嘱，对自己的遗产进行遗嘱信托。子女在未成年之前只能支取生活费，成年后遗产直接转交给子女个人（而非子女的家庭，避免成为子女的夫妻共同财产）。", "char_start": 59, "char_end": 137}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "如果没有子女或者子女意外死亡，那么财产另作处置，处置方案就随你自己了。", "char_start": 138, "char_end": 173}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "3）遗嘱中将一部分遗产指定捐赠给公益机构，以免子女徒生恶念。", "char_start": 174, "char_end": 204}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "每一代的遗嘱都这样写就行了。", "char_start": 205, "char_end": 219}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 6}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0258"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：独生女家庭如何防止被“吃绝户？”？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006"], "summary": "围绕“绝户计”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“两份遗嘱就可以解决问题：”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "两份遗嘱就可以解决问题：", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 12, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "96d6f2e7-f7f8-5bf7-89e2-84fbd4d1a6c6", "source_ordinal": 2359, "reading_ordinal": 1695, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "反社会人格", "published_at": "2023-03-09T00:22:34+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/30879612/answer/2927680454"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "什么是社会性？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 7}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "一加一大于二，这个大于二的超额部分就是社会性。", "char_start": 8, "char_end": 31}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "什么是反社会性？", "char_start": 33, "char_end": 41}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "一加一小于二，这个小于二的缺额就是反社会性。", "char_start": 42, "char_end": 64}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "反社会性的本质，就是要达成有效合作的成本太高，以至于超过了合作所能造成的收益。", "char_start": 66, "char_end": 105}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "显而易见，这样的人如果太多，人群将因为入不敷出，无法自我维持而不能成功构建任何社会结构。", "char_start": 106, "char_end": 150}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "所以这才叫做反社会性。", "char_start": 151, "char_end": 162}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "反社会性非常的常见，绝不是什么杀猫虐狗、连环杀手才有。", "char_start": 163, "char_end": 190}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "过度多疑、强迫性补弱、缺乏礼貌、缺少合作精神、缺少对公共财产的尊重、不遵守社会契约、不尊重传统、不慎重对待社会共识……", "char_start": 191, "char_end": 250}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "一切不利于降低公共产品成本的行为，都有反社会性。", "char_start": 251, "char_end": 275}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "而什么是反社会人格呢？", "char_start": 276, "char_end": 287}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "就是这样的行为本身可以为之带来快感。", "char_start": 288, "char_end": 306}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "例如有盗窃癖、即使没有好处也习惯撒谎、乐于损人不利己、乐于挑拨离间、乐于欺凌……", "char_start": 307, "char_end": 347}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "对将将反社会行为合理化甚至正义化有强烈的偏好。", "char_start": 348, "char_end": 371}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "注意，这不是说这个行为客观上是否有碍社会。", "char_start": 372, "char_end": 393}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "如果当事人自己并不知道这个有碍社会，而是自认为这有益于社会，于是强烈主张，这个不算反社会性，仅仅只是无知。", "char_start": 394, "char_end": 447}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "反社会人格是指当事人非常清楚这个行为会伤害社会、撕裂社会关系，但是正因为如此，ta才要鼓吹和实施。典型的例如恐怖分子。", "char_start": 448, "char_end": 507}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "简单点说，反社会人格的典型特征是见不得别人好、唯恐天下不乱，并且鄙视和蔑视道德。", "char_start": 508, "char_end": 548}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "这并不罕见。", "char_start": 549, "char_end": 555}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "甚至可以这么说——相当一部分人在青少年时期都会有这么一个反社会性猛烈发作的阶段。", "char_start": 556, "char_end": 596}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "一些人并没有完成“否定之否定”而从这个阶段里脱身出来，而是在这个阶段里构建了稳固的快感模式，就此固化了。", "char_start": 597, "char_end": 649}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "这就会形成反社会人格。", "char_start": 650, "char_end": 661}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "这不能说正常，但可以说平常。", "char_start": 662, "char_end": 676}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 25}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0258"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：如何理解反社会人格？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023"], "summary": "围绕“反社会人格”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“什么是社会性？”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "什么是社会性？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 7, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "2c0c9fed-2163-5feb-8b8a-9c3e7cc0b259", "source_ordinal": 2358, "reading_ordinal": 1696, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "两颗香菇", "published_at": "2023-03-09T13:00:26+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/587483600/answer/2928309912"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "青少年发育不完全，情绪稳定性差，所以常会对刺激作出远远超出比例的激烈反应。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 37}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "这是成长过程中的正常现象。先激烈反应，然后面对后果，然后再因为沮丧和悔恨形成抑制机制，对下一次反应的幅度作出自动限制，这本来就是成长和发育的正常规律。", "char_start": 38, "char_end": 113}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "你在沮丧状态下的激素分泌，本身就是促进你的情绪管理器官发育的必要物质基础。所以其实没有必要对此过度反应，正常的总结经验教训即可。", "char_start": 114, "char_end": 178}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "不要因此轻易的自我定义“我就是这样的人”“这是一种治不好的病”。", "char_start": 179, "char_end": 211}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "一旦你走了这条路，原本的沮丧就会被这种自我肯定/自我开解所消解，下一次反应的激烈程度就不会因此获得抑制——你觉得自己没有错、这是你的个性权，或者认定这就是治不了的病，那有什么可抑制的？", "char_start": 212, "char_end": 304}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "你的发育方向就不会是因此感到沮丧和后悔，而是因此感到对社会、对他人的愤怒。", "char_start": 305, "char_end": 342}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "你的行为所造成的他人的痛苦，原本应该引起你本能的沮丧和悔恨，此时却会导致你获得“罪有应得”“活该”的快意。", "char_start": 343, "char_end": 396}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "如果你再到网上去寻求一番其他人的共鸣、安慰，进行二次快感榨取，那么这整个过程很可能会对你形成净快感体验。", "char_start": 397, "char_end": 449}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "如果事情的走向是这样，那么这件事尽管过程复杂曲折，但最终却会给你快感，这往往会进一步的固化甚至提升你下次发作的激烈程度。", "char_start": 450, "char_end": 510}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "简单点说——", "char_start": 511, "char_end": 517}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "以现在的互联网环境，你想要的所有的思想服务都存在着。", "char_start": 518, "char_end": 544}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "给你叫好的，只要你找，一定有。", "char_start": 545, "char_end": 560}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "说你不对的，只要你找，一定有。", "char_start": 561, "char_end": 576}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "安慰你的，只要你找，一定有。", "char_start": 577, "char_end": 591}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "批评你的，只要你找，一定有。", "char_start": 592, "char_end": 606}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "而且绝大部分都既对你没有什么获取成本，供应也很充足。", "char_start": 607, "char_end": 633}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "这意味着当一件事发生，就它对你会构成净快感体验还是会形成抑制这个问题，你拥有比前代人大得多的决定权。", "char_start": 634, "char_end": 684}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "前一代人没有互联网，最多只有邻居，而邻居是不会随便得罪父母的，所以父母的反应垄断了情绪反馈市场，对你这个唯一的消费者达成了塑造。", "char_start": 685, "char_end": 749}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "但现在你想要什么就能拿到什么，而且基本不限量。", "char_start": 750, "char_end": 773}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "客观上，你自己在决定你自己变成什么样的人。", "char_start": 774, "char_end": 795}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "老实说，这对青少年与其说是一种幸运，不如说是一种挑战和考验。", "char_start": 796, "char_end": 826}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "这其实是给青少年去掉了一层保护，过早的将你们丢进了命运的筛选机。", "char_start": 827, "char_end": 859}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "选对了的，在很小的时候就会飞速的成熟。", "char_start": 860, "char_end": 879}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "选错了的，在很小的时候就会误入歧途。", "char_start": 880, "char_end": 898}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "不像三十年前，家长们只是在子女上大学甚至工作之后才结束自己的影响周期。", "char_start": 899, "char_end": 934}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "现在家长们的交卷截止期提前到了子女们学会自由上网为止——ta们只有这么短的时间来影响子女自由接触外界信息时的偏好。", "char_start": 935, "char_end": 992}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "一旦子女可以自由进入信息市场，自由选择情绪产品，ta的预设偏好就会起到关键的作用。", "char_start": 993, "char_end": 1034}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "除非，ta运气很好，看到一些足以改变ta偏好的东西。", "char_start": 1035, "char_end": 1061}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "比如现在这一篇。", "char_start": 1062, "char_end": 1070}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "这篇东西，是为了告知这个事实——", "char_start": 1072, "char_end": 1088}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "其实你对你自己的发育方向有决定权。", "char_start": 1089, "char_end": 1106}, {"paragraph_id": "P032", "field": "body", "index": 32, "text": "你决定关注谁，决定听从什么，对你的未来有深远的影响。", "char_start": 1107, "char_end": 1133}, {"paragraph_id": "P033", "field": "body", "index": 33, "text": "你想要借助这些外部信源去引导自己确信某个理念一点没错，你一定会达到你的目的，你只是需要面对这样做的客观后果。", "char_start": 1134, "char_end": 1188}, {"paragraph_id": "P034", "field": "body", "index": 34, "text": "你要根据这理念的客观后果来选择理念，而不要再根据“这个理念有多少人赞同”来选择你的理念。", "char_start": 1189, "char_end": 1233}, {"paragraph_id": "P035", "field": "body", "index": 35, "text": "走后一条路实际上是无意义的——因为一定会有足够的人赞同。", "char_start": 1234, "char_end": 1262}, {"paragraph_id": "P036", "field": "body", "index": 36, "text": "你要主张父母皆祸害，一定会有足够多的人赞同。问题是这之后是什么？", "char_start": 1263, "char_end": 1295}, {"paragraph_id": "P037", "field": "body", "index": 37, "text": "你要主张“女权皆恶魔”，一定会有足够多的人赞同。问题是这之后是什么？", "char_start": 1296, "char_end": 1330}, {"paragraph_id": "P038", "field": "body", "index": 38, "text": "“这之后是什么”才是你需要在意的唯一的决定你立场的要素。", "char_start": 1331, "char_end": 1359}, {"paragraph_id": "P039", "field": "body", "index": 39, "text": "妈妈吃掉两颗香菇，你把厨房砸了，你想要主张这没有错误，只要你努力筛选、寻找，你一定可以获得足够多的赞同者来同意你什么问题也没有。", "char_start": 1360, "char_end": 1424}, {"paragraph_id": "P040", "field": "body", "index": 40, "text": "问题是，“吃香菇砸厨房没有错”之后是什么？", "char_start": 1425, "char_end": 1446}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 41}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0258"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：妈妈吃掉了我两颗香菇，我疯狂的辱骂她我把厨房砸了，我这是怎么了？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031", "P032", "P033", "P034", "P035", "P036", "P037", "P038", "P039", "P040"], "summary": "围绕“两颗香菇”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“青少年发育不完全，情绪稳定性差，所以常会对刺激作出远远超出比例的激烈反应。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "青少年发育不完全，情绪稳定性差，所以常会对刺激作出远远超出比例的激烈反应。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 37, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "ccfa4e9f-37df-5bd4-8c54-f3c1e8f710d3", "source_ordinal": 2357, "reading_ordinal": 1697, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "6080", "published_at": "2023-03-11T01:04:22+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/585309505/answer/2930796807"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "这么说吧。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 5}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "作为团队领袖，在分配任务的时候一般秉持的是稳健原则。", "char_start": 6, "char_end": 32}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "什么叫稳健原则呢？", "char_start": 33, "char_end": 42}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "就是你自称可以扛80，我也相信你可以扛80。", "char_start": 43, "char_end": 65}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "但是我只会分60给你扛。", "char_start": 66, "char_end": 78}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "这倒不是不信任你，而是让你扛80，一旦有个什么三长两短，就可能超出你的极限。", "char_start": 79, "char_end": 117}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "你掉链子，全组都要倒霉。", "char_start": 118, "char_end": 130}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "所以，你能扛80，也只会给你扛60。", "char_start": 131, "char_end": 149}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "这跟“信不过你的能力”有什么关系呢？", "char_start": 151, "char_end": 169}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "因为一旦你没扛住，你的问题就是“自认能扛80，却被事实证明扛不住60”。", "char_start": 170, "char_end": 206}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "问题还不止如此。", "char_start": 207, "char_end": 215}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "你没扛住60。意味着你的上限还不是60，而是还在60之下。", "char_start": 216, "char_end": 245}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "到底是多少，还得测试一下才知道。", "char_start": 246, "char_end": 262}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "假设是40，按照稳健原则意味着只能让你扛30甚至25。", "char_start": 263, "char_end": 290}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "一个按照80的自称招进来的人，最后只能让你扛30-25。", "char_start": 291, "char_end": 319}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "但你的工资是按照30-25给的吗？", "char_start": 320, "char_end": 337}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "你看懂“领导不信任你的能力”的基本逻辑了吗？", "char_start": 338, "char_end": 360}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "你有什么教训可以吸取？", "char_start": 362, "char_end": 373}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "第一，绝对不要高估和夸大你的上限，把60上限吹到80，结果分到60的任务却玩脱了。", "char_start": 374, "char_end": 415}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "一来这种极限压力你的容错率太低，极易出问题。", "char_start": 416, "char_end": 438}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "二来在老大眼里你应该还有余力，那么团队整体出了点什么意外还要指望你这里可以有余力分担点。", "char_start": 439, "char_end": 483}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "再给你盘子里分个10，你咽得下去吗？", "char_start": 484, "char_end": 502}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "有人会喊冤——我不吹到80，我够不到人家的入门门槛啊！", "char_start": 503, "char_end": 530}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "那么你就是明知故犯嘛，那你炸锅了你喊什么冤？", "char_start": 531, "char_end": 553}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "你有九成以上的“扛80没出问题”的事实纪录，你再报80。", "char_start": 554, "char_end": 582}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "如果你是凭这种实际业绩进来的，那么你偶尔没扛住也会被理解为偶然意外。", "char_start": 583, "char_end": 617}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "但如果你是没有实际经验，仅仅只是自我感觉良好加贪图录取夸大其词，那么后面的情节你就要认。", "char_start": 618, "char_end": 662}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "别来“领导不信任”这一套。", "char_start": 663, "char_end": 676}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "坦率讲，只要是自己招人的领导，没有对招进来的人从一开始就不信任的。只有自己的下属不是来自自己的招揽选择，而是从别处直接被调来、被指派来的这种情况，领导才会在一开始就保持怀疑和警惕。", "char_start": 678, "char_end": 768}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "但就算是后一种情况，ta也一定会问你你搞不搞得定，而不会随便就假定你没问题乱分任务。", "char_start": 769, "char_end": 811}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "如果是你自己说了没问题，结果出了问题，那么就还是你有问题。", "char_start": 812, "char_end": 841}, {"paragraph_id": "P032", "field": "body", "index": 32, "text": "2）你必须要交付，而且要高质量的交付。", "char_start": 843, "char_end": 862}, {"paragraph_id": "P033", "field": "body", "index": 33, "text": "你要知道，给你的任务只是60/80的任务。是按照你应该绝对有能力搞定的口径给的。", "char_start": 863, "char_end": 903}, {"paragraph_id": "P034", "field": "body", "index": 34, "text": "那么这60的任务你应该完成得接近满分，不是吗？", "char_start": 904, "char_end": 927}, {"paragraph_id": "P035", "field": "body", "index": 35, "text": "自称能举80的人安排你举60，结果你手抖腿颤、少挺半秒就要判失败了，纯属擦线低空飞过，你不觉得有问题吗？", "char_start": 928, "char_end": 980}, {"paragraph_id": "P036", "field": "body", "index": 36, "text": "你如果说的是真话，那么你的挺举应该轻松自如，高分（如果不是满分的话）完成。", "char_start": 981, "char_end": 1018}, {"paragraph_id": "P037", "field": "body", "index": 37, "text": "你交出来的东西的质量应该不容置疑的体现出游刃有余感。", "char_start": 1019, "char_end": 1045}, {"paragraph_id": "P038", "field": "body", "index": 38, "text": "质量勉强及格尚且不行，更不必谈“交不出”了。", "char_start": 1046, "char_end": 1068}, {"paragraph_id": "P039", "field": "body", "index": 39, "text": "结果刚出校门的学生们还觉得交不出或者质量马马虎虎只是像学校一样，了不起请一下家长，或者批评两句。", "char_start": 1070, "char_end": 1118}, {"paragraph_id": "P040", "field": "body", "index": 40, "text": "其实你只要搞这么一次，基本上你就已经进了淘汰名单，因为你还没活醒。", "char_start": 1119, "char_end": 1152}, {"paragraph_id": "P041", "field": "body", "index": 41, "text": "领到的任务，你必须高质量的完成。至少要80分。", "char_start": 1154, "char_end": 1177}, {"paragraph_id": "P042", "field": "body", "index": 42, "text": "必须。", "char_start": 1178, "char_end": 1181}, {"paragraph_id": "P043", "field": "body", "index": 43, "text": "你没有打折扣、讲借口的空间，每次都是背水一战。", "char_start": 1182, "char_end": 1205}, {"paragraph_id": "P044", "field": "heading", "index": 44, "text": "因为你的老板给你的是60/80的任务。", "char_start": 1206, "char_end": 1225}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 49, "heading": 1}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0258"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：领导不信任你的能力，对你有意见，还有必要跟着他干下去吗？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031", "P032", "P033", "P034", "P035", "P036", "P037", "P038", "P039", "P040", "P041", "P042", "P043", "P044"], "summary": "围绕“6080”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“这么说吧。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "这么说吧。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 5, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "4f9b9ca8-8cc4-525e-8c76-8f8475881256", "source_ordinal": 2356, "reading_ordinal": 1698, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "黑粉菌", "published_at": "2023-03-11T11:59:50+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/588149838/answer/2931222016"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "有一种东西叫黑粉菌。其实很多人每天都在吃它，但是却不知道。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 29}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "当它感染了菰的花茎，发病的花茎被采摘下来叫做茭白。", "char_start": 31, "char_end": 56}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "很少有人知道这其实是病变部位，还以为是天生就长这样。", "char_start": 58, "char_end": 84}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "但当它感染了玉米，简直浑身都透露着“我有病”的信号。", "char_start": 86, "char_end": 112}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "警告——图片可能引起不适。", "char_start": 113, "char_end": 126}], "images": [{"image_id": "IMG001", "src": "//asset.sooon.ai/p/2023-03/11/8e423886cca34be0a99186796d564d63.jpg", "status": "pending", "ocr_text": "", "visual_notes": ""}, {"image_id": "IMG002", "src": "//asset.sooon.ai/p/2023-03/11/19840891c514d9ee2bfcd647b0e6bb35.jpg", "status": "pending", "ocr_text": "", "visual_notes": ""}, {"image_id": "IMG003", "src": "//asset.sooon.ai/p/2023-03/11/f0fa7da8eb458980643745dbd5e73070.jpg", "status": "pending", "ocr_text": "", "visual_notes": ""}], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 45, "image": 3}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "needs_reread", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0258"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：哪些植物看着有毒其实可以食用？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005"], "summary": "围绕“黑粉菌”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“有一种东西叫黑粉菌。其实很多人每天都在吃它，但是却不知道。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "有一种东西叫黑粉菌。其实很多人每天都在吃它，但是却不知道。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 29, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。 含图片节点，图片未经核验。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "810a4734-3c29-5b4d-80cb-1c217b762785", "source_ordinal": 4293, "reading_ordinal": 1699, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "工贼", "published_at": "2023-03-11T14:28:05+08:00", "platform": "afdian", "url": "https://afdian.com/p/e20de0bebfd511edbbf95254001e7c00"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "一次性解决这个问题：", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 10}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "如果一个国家是工人阶级的敌人，其存在的目的就是为了有意维持工人阶级的最小生存必要而获得最大可能利润。", "char_start": 11, "char_end": 61}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "那么这个国家的所有合法企业就自动成为剥削工人阶级的系统工具。因而任何工人阶级成员与这剥削机器的合作，都在延长这个庞大机器对所有阶级兄弟的压迫和奴役。", "char_start": 62, "char_end": 136}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "这构成对本阶级的背叛，是为工贼。", "char_start": 137, "char_end": 153}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "反过来，如果一个国家本身为工人阶级所有，所有企业经营的主观目的或客观效用是积累属于全体劳动者的财富，建设所有人最好的生活。", "char_start": 154, "char_end": 215}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "那么鼓吹在其治下的任何合法企业里消极劳动、恶意破坏，就构成对整个工人阶级总体利益的出卖和背叛，意图使工人阶级的祖国在敌我竞争中不得胜。", "char_start": 216, "char_end": 283}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "这构成对本阶级的背叛，是为工贼。", "char_start": 284, "char_end": 300}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "通俗点讲，", "char_start": 301, "char_end": 306}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "在别人家扛长工，鼓吹消极劳动多拿点工钱也许有合理性。", "char_start": 307, "char_end": 333}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "这个家里的家产是由你们这帮兄弟姐妹继承和所有的，你在自己家里鼓吹一起不做家务，还指责不听你“号召”的兄弟姐妹是“叛徒”，你自己想想，是不是脑子有水？", "char_start": 334, "char_end": 408}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "实话跟你说——这些词的政治意味极其深刻，不是你自己可以随便拿着玩的。", "char_start": 409, "char_end": 443}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "天下太平就随你开开玩笑，但要是真的社会动荡，你的行动如果涉及乱用这些词为名义，其性质直接涉嫌反对社会主义制度和意图颠覆国家政权。", "char_start": 444, "char_end": 508}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "以后搞清楚这一点，不要稀里糊涂跟着一些蠢人胡说八道。", "char_start": 509, "char_end": 535}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "何况这些人未必真的是蠢。", "char_start": 536, "char_end": 548}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 14}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0258"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：奋斗逼是工贼吗？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014"], "summary": "围绕“工贼”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“一次性解决这个问题：”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "一次性解决这个问题：", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 10, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "51284a30-51f7-5562-a26a-055619019b36", "source_ordinal": 2355, "reading_ordinal": 1700, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "末法", "published_at": "2023-03-12T03:07:47+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/571807772/answer/2932193644"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "那叫比我们领先，不叫比我们强。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 15}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "举个例子，我们曾经在火药、地磁导航、印刷、造纸等多个关键领域毫无疑问的领先。", "char_start": 16, "char_end": 54}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "但是历史很清晰的证明——在这些领域我们的领先并不意味着我们强。", "char_start": 55, "char_end": 86}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "风帆战舰其实是荷兰和西班牙领先，但是却是英格兰更强。", "char_start": 87, "char_end": 113}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "坦克是英国领先，但却是德国更强。", "char_start": 114, "char_end": 130}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "如果你比较关心时事，你会发现这个“你领先，但是我更强”的逻辑最近已经有了很多令欧美毛骨悚然的案例。", "char_start": 132, "char_end": 181}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "高铁是欧日领先，但却显而易见的是我们更强。", "char_start": 182, "char_end": 203}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "太阳能、风电、锂电池、电动车、高压输电、盾构机、船舶设计与制造……", "char_start": 204, "char_end": 237}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "几乎都是欧美领先——甚至至今都领先——但却是我们更强。", "char_start": 238, "char_end": 265}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "我们的秘诀并不是“始终领先”。", "char_start": 266, "char_end": 281}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "而是我们学会了一种要人命的魔法——大规模应用。而这魔法的底层保障恰恰是西方最痛恨的“极权统治”。", "char_start": 282, "char_end": 330}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "随你什么领先技术，没有足以穿金洞石的“极权统治”去降妖除魔，要真的大规模落地就跟唐三藏取经一样难。", "char_start": 331, "char_end": 380}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "此山乃物质文化遗存，本座为迷茫性少数，座下皆为多元文化少数族裔，你想从此空手白过？", "char_start": 381, "char_end": 422}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "How dare you？", "char_start": 423, "char_end": 436}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "而在中国呢？取经的是悟空。", "char_start": 438, "char_end": 451}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "这妖孽毫无礼貌，生就一副毛脸雷公嘴，最是不解风情。一根铁棒一万三千五百斤，迎风晃一晃碗口般粗，口头禅不是“且把孤拐伸来与你打个样”，就是“若道出半个不字，就自家搓根绳儿去吧，免得你外公动手”。", "char_start": 452, "char_end": 548}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "没了唐三藏，悟空solo版西游记的情节只够画四格。", "char_start": 549, "char_end": 574}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "现在真正的问题，根本不是谁先悟出新的奥义，而是有些在三摩地中修行的善男子，取经得比西天写得都快。而且拿回家就野蛮操作，魔界修得比西天还极乐。", "char_start": 575, "char_end": 645}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "搞出新的经书当然是大好的喜事，但是大家都知道，也就高兴那么几天。", "char_start": 647, "char_end": 679}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "后面的剧情很可能还是一样——虽然领先，但却是对面更强。", "char_start": 680, "char_end": 707}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "虽有如来，却无悟空。", "char_start": 709, "char_end": 719}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "如来解决不了悟空的问题，这才是末法世界的痛苦所在。", "char_start": 720, "char_end": 745}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 27}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0258"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：为什么感觉欧美AI比我们强？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022"], "summary": "围绕“末法”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“那叫比我们领先，不叫比我们强。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "那叫比我们领先，不叫比我们强。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 15, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "2253eb66-b209-5ffa-b95f-f02f49276a29", "source_ordinal": 2354, "reading_ordinal": 1701, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "劫后余生", "published_at": "2023-03-12T05:37:41+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/588766921/answer/2932218817"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "没学过绘画的人，往往自己觉得用AI做出来的东西“和大厂美宣，漫威海报一个等级”。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 40}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "这个倒不是故意自夸，是自己真的看不出有什么地方不如。甚至，不但没啥地方不如，很多地方还比它们强呢。", "char_start": 41, "char_end": 90}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "但实际上，观众——尤其是付费的观众和出资制作的业主这两类有利害关系的关键客户——往往出乎你意料的并不同意。", "char_start": 91, "char_end": 144}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "这个问题在美术画室里很常见——作者自己觉得简直完美无缺，一点毛病都没有。但是在同学和老师看来简直惨不忍睹，浑身错得四面漏风，难以理解作者自己为啥这么密集的错误就硬是看不见。", "char_start": 145, "char_end": 231}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "观察能力、设计能力、鉴赏能力，跟表现能力不是一回事。AI可以帮你解决一部分表现问题，但是如果你自己缺少观察能力、设计能力、鉴赏能力，你很难给予AI有效的指导。", "char_start": 232, "char_end": 311}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "结果AI如同一个非常厉害的乙方遇上了一个一头雾水、语焉不详的甲方。盲人骑赤兔，飞速打转。", "char_start": 312, "char_end": 356}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "问题来了——这份鉴赏和设计能力有没有可能不靠手绘练习，而是从头到尾都靠AI创作来获得？", "char_start": 358, "char_end": 401}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "这个嘛，暂时不把话说死，但是至少没有这么显然的乐观。", "char_start": 402, "char_end": 428}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "这并不是问题的全部。", "char_start": 429, "char_end": 439}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "这个问题更艰难的部分在于，艺术并不是一个“才能比赛”。那只是一种表象。", "char_start": 441, "char_end": 476}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "艺术在本质上是一种信仰活动。", "char_start": 477, "char_end": 491}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "寂寞、迷茫、痛苦、牺牲，是一个人从爱好者转向艺术家的必备要素。漫长而“没有人性”的手绘课程，表面上是在学习和磨练技能，但本质上却是在献祭。", "char_start": 492, "char_end": 561}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "不断的，不断的献祭。", "char_start": 562, "char_end": 572}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "这种分筋错骨的献祭才会炼化出足够深刻、勇猛、坚毅、热情的灵魂。", "char_start": 573, "char_end": 604}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "是这种被熬出来的灵魂才敢于舍弃一切顾虑，顶着一事无成、一文不值的恐吓，才能一头扎进没人看好甚至没人看见的幽暗通玄的深渊、才有这个毅力在伸手不见五指的地穴里摸索。", "char_start": 605, "char_end": 685}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "才有可能去到无人之境，拿回一些还无人认识的宝石来。", "char_start": 686, "char_end": 711}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "这些东西，是AI根本无法企及的。", "char_start": 712, "char_end": 728}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "它不是旧有之物的又一种随机组合，而是有一些新的东西。", "char_start": 729, "char_end": 755}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "没人见过、想到过、做出过的东西。", "char_start": 756, "char_end": 772}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "值钱的是这样的东西。别的那些乱七八糟的只是包珍珠用的雕花盒子。", "char_start": 773, "char_end": 804}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "你也许确实可以做到在技术上用AI来替代传统手绘。", "char_start": 806, "char_end": 830}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "但是，如果你抱着“这样就不必经受手绘修炼的痛苦”的心态，那么你从一开始就毫无希望。", "char_start": 831, "char_end": 872}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "因为你搞错了重点——重点不是手绘，而是那个痛苦。", "char_start": 873, "char_end": 897}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "说得不好听一点，你甚至可以用种地、开矿去替代手绘，只要你经历同样的痛苦。", "char_start": 898, "char_end": 934}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "艺术的门槛不在画，而在这个以苦、以死为路的死而复生。", "char_start": 935, "char_end": 961}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "只不过大多数人一般选择了手绘作为这个“死法”，以便在死而复生之后让表现技术的短板也被补齐而已。", "char_start": 962, "char_end": 1009}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "那份“上穷碧落下黄泉，两处茫茫皆不见”的历劫，你是不能免的。", "char_start": 1010, "char_end": 1040}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "免了你就始终在门外。免了你就永远是业余过家家。", "char_start": 1041, "char_end": 1064}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "免了，你将永远也理解不了你撸出来的这个东西和ta们搞出来的到底有什么不一样。", "char_start": 1065, "char_end": 1103}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "因为免了的话，你是扛不住艺术创作天然必备的那份痛苦拷问的。", "char_start": 1104, "char_end": 1133}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "那是要拷问到每一笔、每一个点的。", "char_start": 1134, "char_end": 1150}, {"paragraph_id": "P032", "field": "body", "index": 32, "text": "那是个比扛大包更苦、更累的力气活。", "char_start": 1151, "char_end": 1168}, {"paragraph_id": "P033", "field": "body", "index": 33, "text": "而且还不是光有力气就能大力出奇迹的。", "char_start": 1169, "char_end": 1187}, {"paragraph_id": "P034", "field": "body", "index": 34, "text": "你要用AI而不用手绘，可以。", "char_start": 1189, "char_end": 1203}, {"paragraph_id": "P035", "field": "body", "index": 35, "text": "那么做好准备——你也要用AI练出你的“死去活来”，不要有任何侥幸。", "char_start": 1204, "char_end": 1237}, {"paragraph_id": "P036", "field": "body", "index": 36, "text": "到时候你会发现——论这个死法，用AI其实并不比用手绘优越到哪去。", "char_start": 1238, "char_end": 1270}, {"paragraph_id": "P037", "field": "body", "index": 37, "text": "左右都要先死后活，建议你好好的历劫，不要无谓的浪费。", "char_start": 1271, "char_end": 1297}, {"paragraph_id": "P038", "field": "body", "index": 38, "text": "手绘的传统，什么时候会闭气、什么时候会昏厥、什么时候该人工呼吸、什么时候该心脏起搏，已经有无数前辈摸得透透的了。", "char_start": 1298, "char_end": 1354}, {"paragraph_id": "P039", "field": "body", "index": 39, "text": "但是AI这种做法，什么时候会休克，休克了拿什么救醒，还不知道。", "char_start": 1355, "char_end": 1386}, {"paragraph_id": "P040", "field": "body", "index": 40, "text": "甚至，能不能作为一种历劫手段还不太清楚。", "char_start": 1387, "char_end": 1407}, {"paragraph_id": "P041", "field": "body", "index": 41, "text": "理性而言，你还是老实的手绘历劫为好。", "char_start": 1409, "char_end": 1427}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 46}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0258"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：有了ai，学画画还有意义吗？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031", "P032", "P033", "P034", "P035", "P036", "P037", "P038", "P039", "P040", "P041"], "summary": "围绕“劫后余生”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“没学过绘画的人，往往自己觉得用AI做出来的东西“和大厂美宣，漫威海报一个等级”。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "没学过绘画的人，往往自己觉得用AI做出来的东西“和大厂美宣，漫威海报一个等级”。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 40, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
